OL,3,AAsos says customers' personal
OL,4,Ainformation 'may have been accessed'
OL,5,Aafter message from apparent hackers
OL,6,
OL,7,FAsos says it is "investigating
OL,8,Funauthorised activity" after app users
OL,9,Freceived a pop-up message from apparent
OL,10,Fhackers - here's what we know so far
OL,12,FCustomers' "basic personal information
OL,13,Fincluding name and contact details may
OL,14,Fhave been accessed," the online
OL,15,Fretailer says, adding it doesn't think
OL,16,Fpayment information or account
OL,17,Fpasswords were impacted
OL,19,FThe notification - sent earlier - said:
OL,20,F"Dear Asos DPO and IT, we have fully
OL,21,Fcompromised the Snowflake instance.
OL,22,FEngage with us, or we will leak it"
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
