OL,6,
OL,7,FAn Asos customer told the BBC they were
OL,8,F"scared to go into" the app. Another,
OL,9,FJodie from Edinburgh, said "it's
OL,10,Fconcerning if it's a data leak"
OL,12,FDid you get the notification? Here's
OL,13,Fwhat you should do
